    <string name="rescuer_none">Nothing sealed to open yet.</string>
    <string name="rescuer_no_key">This build does not contain a rescuer key, so it cannot open a sealed body. That is the intended behaviour for a shared build: only a rescuer should be able to read an SOS location.</string>
